      "subject": "Kariyaw",
      "rationale": "הַכָּרִי (Kariyaw \/ Karetaw) — jamana tɔgɔ walima janfa-tɔgɔ min dɔnni tɛ ɲɛ: Keretaw (Krita), walima sɔrɔ 'sarakabasebagaw' ko ka Kari bila"
    },
    {
      "kind": "idiom",
      "subject": "layidu kɛ",
      "rationale": "וַיִּכְרֹת בְּרִית kɔrɔlen ye 'ka layidu kɛ' ye — Heburukan fɔ ko 'o kɔrɔta dɔrɔn' (fili-sira min bɛ saraka-pɛsɛw cɛ); Bamanankan tɛ o fen in mɛn"
    },
    {
      "kind": "wordplay",
      "subject": "וישבע",
      "rationale": "שֶׁבַע (wolonfila) ni לִשְׁבֹּעַ (ka se) bɛ Heburukan kɔnɔ — 'ka wolonfila la jiko' dɔgɔya Bamanankan na"
    }
  ],
  "translation": "San wolonfilanan na, Yehoyada ye mɔgɔw ci ka ⟨את⟩ kɛmɛtigiw — Kariyaw ni garakɛlaw — ta, ka u na a fɛ Yawe so kɔnɔ; a ye layidu kɛ u ye, a ye u se Yawe so kɔnɔ, a ye ⟨את⟩ masakɛ denkɛ jira u ye.",
